  m_Name: Post Vision - Vase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JusticeIsAWeapon.Data.DialogueNodeSO
  nodeId: Post Vision - Vase
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "That confirms it. The vase didn't shatter because of a clumsy fall\u2014it
    was the murder weapon. He was dead before that empty vial ever touched his pocket.\r\n\r\nThe
    killer didn't panic. They walked out and shut that heavy door behind them. If
    the electronic lock engaged when they left, there has to be a digital footprint
    logged in the system\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
